abstract: >-
  Verbatim text of Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 (the EU Artificial Intelligence
  Act) in all 24 official EU languages, sourced from EUR-Lex / EU Publications
  Office CELLAR. Covers all 113 Articles, 180 Recitals, and Annex sections,
  with stable identifiers, parallel structure across languages, and a unified
  JSON schema. Released under EU Decision 2011/833/EU (text) and CC BY 4.0
  (curation/metadata).
